From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sm64ar <sm64ar@localhost>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Fix upstream memory-safety bugs

Upstream bugs found with AddressSanitizer, fixed for every build mode:
- background_gamepad is a bool registered in the config table as a uint, so
  saving read 4 bytes and loading wrote 4 bytes through sscanf;
- patch_mtx_interpolated used camera-space matrix buffers after their scope
  ended;
- rom_assets_decompress read the MIO0 magic past the end of a segment shorter
  than its header;
- eight hoot display lists loaded 12 vertices from 6-vertex arrays. Their
  triangles only use vertices 0-5, so loading 6 draws the same pixels without
  the over-read.
---
 actors/hoot/model.inc.c         | 16 ++++++++--------
 src/audio/ar_audio_hooks.h      |  0
 src/game/ar_game_hooks.h        |  0
 src/game/rendering_graph_node.c |  2 +-
 src/goddard/ar_goddard.h        |  0
 src/pc/configfile.c             |  6 +++---
 src/pc/gfx/gfx_ar_hooks.h       |  0
 src/pc/rom_assets.c             |  3 +++
 8 files changed, 15 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 src/audio/ar_audio_hooks.h
 create mode 100644 src/game/ar_game_hooks.h
 create mode 100644 src/goddard/ar_goddard.h
 create mode 100644 src/pc/gfx/gfx_ar_hooks.h

